{start_of_verse label="Verse 1"}
Once a [D]jolly swagman [A]camped
By a [D]billa[G]bong,
[D]Under the shade of a [Em]coolabah [A]tree,
And he [D]sang as he watched and [A]waited
Till his [D]billy [G]boiled,
[D]Who'll come a-[A]waltzing Ma[D]tilda with me?
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[D]Waltzing Ma[G]tilda, [D]waltzing Ma[A]tilda,
[D]Who'll come a-[Bm]waltzing Ma[E7]tilda with [A]me.
And he [D]sang as he watched and [A]waited
Till his [D]billy [G]boiled,
[D]Who'll come a-[A]waltzing Ma[D]tilda with me.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse label="Verse 2"}
Down came a [D]jumbuck to [A]drink
At the [D]billa[G]bong,
[D]Up jumped the swagman and [Em]grabbed him with [A]glee,
And he [D]sang as he shoved that [A]jumbuck
In his [D]tucker-[G]bag,
[D]You'll come a-[A]waltzing Ma[D]tilda with me.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[D]Waltzing Ma[G]tilda, [D]waltzing Ma[A]tilda,
[D]You'll come a-[Bm]waltzing Ma[E7]tilda with [A]me.
And he [D]sang as he shoved that [A]jumbuck
In his [D]tucker-[G]bag,
[D]You'll come a-[A]waltzing Ma[D]tilda with me.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse label="Verse 3"}
[D]Up rode a squatter, [A]mounted
On his [D]thorough[G]bred;
[D]Down came the troopers, [Em]one, two, [A]three:
[D]Who's that jolly [A]jumbuck
You've got in your [D]tucker-[G]bag?
[D]You'll come a-[A]waltzing Ma[D]tilda with me!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[D]Waltzing Ma[G]tilda, [D]waltzing Ma[A]tilda,
[D]You'll come a-[Bm]waltzing Ma[E7]tilda with [A]me.
[D]Who's that jolly [A]jumbuck
You've got in your [D]tucker-[G]bag?
[D]You'll come a-[A]waltzing Ma[D]tilda with me.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse label="Verse 4"}
[D]Up jumped the swagman and [A]sprang
Into the [D]billa[G]bong;
[D]"You'll never catch me a[Em]live!" said [A]he;
And his [D]ghost may be heard as you [A]pass
By that [D]billa[G]bong,
[D]You'll come a-[A]waltzing Ma[D]tilda with me!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[D]Waltzing Ma[G]tilda, [D]waltzing Ma[A]tilda,
[D]You'll come a-[Bm]waltzing Ma[E7]tilda with [A]me.
And his [D]ghost may be heard as you [A]pass
By that [D]billa[G]bong,
[D]You'll come a-[A]waltzing Ma[D]tilda with me.
{end_of_chorus}
{x_end: D}
